      "node_id": "kg_doc_2",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Title: Tunnels &amp; Trolls. Tunnels & Trolls (abbreviated \"T&T\") is a fantasy role-playing game designed by Ken St. Andre and first published in 1975 by Flying Buffalo. The second modern role-playing game published, it was written by Ken St. Andre to be a more accessible alternative to \"Dungeons & Dragons\" and is suitable for solitaire, group, and play-by-mail gameplay.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999933241692,
